Package: mesa-vulkan-drivers
Section: libs
Architecture: arm64
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: libvulkan1, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: vulkan-icd
Multi-Arch: same
Description: Mesa Vulkan graphics drivers
 Vulkan is a low-overhead 3D graphics and compute API. This package
 includes Aurora's Borealis Vulkan driver for Apple Silicon
 GPUs, the lavapipe software driver and Mesa's Vulkan layers.

Package: mesa-opencl-icd
Section: libs
Architecture: arm64
Build-Profiles: <!cross>
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends:
 libclc-21,
 ocl-icd-libopencl1 | libopencl1,
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: opencl-icd
Multi-Arch: same
Description: free implementation of the OpenCL API -- ICD runtime
 This package contains Mesa's Rusticl implementation of the OpenCL (Open
 Compute Language) library, which is intended for use with an ICD loader.
 OpenCL provides a standardized interface for computational analysis on
 graphical processing units.
